# Access policy of the methods of elevations.midl (MIKSPEC-0023.R47).
# Bootstrap, ChildBootstrap, InitBootstrap and ManagerBootstrap are served only on the
# channels that init, the process manager and the service manager give each
# other at start; Elevations only to the session manager, through
# Launcher.OpenElevations.

Elevations.SetAdmin: public
Elevations.GetAdmin: public
